        "original_id": "bf8ee0fd-5128-56a7-bde7-efebd2d5c1a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Luchins, Hubert Humphrey, Daniel Patrick Moynihan\n- Roles: aide, Vice President of the United States, Senate staff\n- Organizations: United States Senate\n\nFacts:\n- Hubert Humphrey served as the 38th Vice President of the United States from 1965 to 1969.\n- Hubert Humphrey was an American politician born on May 27, 1911, and he died on January 13, 1978.\n- David Luchins served as an aide to Vice President Hubert Humphrey.\n- David Luchins served for 20 years on the Senate staff of New York Senator Daniel Patrick Moynihan.",
